  m_text: 'Controls:

    WASD - Movement

    Q/MMB - Grapple

    E - Swing (I''ll
    combine grapple + swinging later)

    RMB - Ranged Attack (limit 100 for now
    with no way to replenish)

    LMB - Melee

    LShift - Dash

    LShift hold
    - Sprint

    X - Spawn Enemy

    A+ - The Grade you should give me :)'
